# iNaturalist computer-vision token for the camera sheet's identify step.
#
# Without it the sheet replays a recorded iNat reply and says so on screen —
# it never claims to have looked at your photo. With it, the photo is POSTed to
# api.inaturalist.org/v1/computervision/score_image and the suggestions are live.
#
# Get one by signing in at inaturalist.org and copying the JWT from
# https://www.inaturalist.org/users/api_token (value of `api_token`).
# The token is short-lived (~24h) — refresh it before a demo.
#
# Vite inlines this at BUILD time, so it ships in the bundle. Use a throwaway
# account, never a personal one with observations you care about.
VITE_INAT_API_TOKEN=
